<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka rupee at record low 56.60/dlr--dealers.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka rupee at record low 56.60/dlr--dealers.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lankan rupee ended at an all-time low 56.60 to the dollar on speculation combined with import covering, dealers said.</p>
<p>This compares with the previous close of 56.45 to the dollar on Wednesday and the previous record low of 56.55 set on September 19. The market was closed on Thursday for a public holiday.</p>
